{"speciesId":405,"names":{"fr":"Luxray","es":"Luxray","en":"Luxray","ja":"レントラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has eyes that can see through anything. It spots and captures prey hiding behind objects."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When its eyes gleam gold, it can spot hiding prey--even those taking shelter behind a wall."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"LUXRAY’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"LUXRAY’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est capable de voir à travers les murs pour chasser des proies ou retrouver ses petits égarés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est capable de voir à travers les murs pour chasser des proies ou retrouver ses petits égarés."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand ses yeux se dorent, il peut repérer une proie cachée, même si elle est derrière un mur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando sus ojos brillan como el oro, puede ver presas escondidas, incluso detrás de un muro."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When its eyes gleam gold, it can spot hiding prey--even those taking shelter behind a wall."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"瞳が 金色に 光るとき 壁の 向こうに 隠れている 獲物を 見つけることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa capacité à voir à travers tout est très utile pour détecter les moindres dangers."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La potente visión de Luxray resulta extremadamente valiosa cuando acecha el peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Luxray’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"レントラーの 透視能力は 危険な ものを 発見するとき とても 役に立つのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand ses yeux se dorent, il peut repérer une proie cachée, même si elle est derrière un mur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando sus ojos brillan como el oro, puede ver presas escondidas, incluso detrás de un muro."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When its eyes gleam gold, it can spot hiding prey—even those taking shelter behind a wall."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"瞳が 金色に 光るとき 壁の 向こうに 隠れている 獲物を 見つけることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa capacité à voir à travers tout est très utile pour détecter les moindres dangers."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La potente visión de Luxray resulta extremadamente valiosa cuando acecha el peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Luxray’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"レントラーの 透視能力は 危険な ものを 発見するとき とても 役に立つのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa capacité à voir à travers la matière lui permet de repérer en un instant des proies cachées derrière un mur épais."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Tiene la capacidad de ver a través de cualquier cosa. Encuentra enseguida su presa, aunque se oculte tras una pared de gran grosor."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Luxray can see through solid objects. It will instantly spot prey trying to hide behind walls, even if the walls are thick."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"透視能力を もつ ポケモン。 厚い 壁の 向こうに 隠れる 獲物を たちまち 見つけだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il dort beaucoup pour récupérer la quantité d’énergie électrique énorme qu’il consomme afin de voir à travers la matière."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Duerme durante largos períodos para recuperar la enorme cantidad de electricidad que consume al usar su capacidad para ver a través de objetos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Seeing through solid objects uses up a lot of Luxray’s electricity, so the Pokémon sleeps for long periods of time to store up energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"透視は 電気エネルギーを ひどく 消耗するため 長時間 眠り エネルギーを 蓄える。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"They form packs, each having one male as leader. Legends say that when Luxray's two eyes shimmer with gold, the Pokémon can see through anything."}],"varieties":[{"id":405,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",5],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",5],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",5],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",18],[10,"level-up",18],[11,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",18],[15,